<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpite Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz, Hezekiah, le Israel kumpi Joash’ tapa Kumpi Jeroboam hun lai-in Beeri’ tapa Hosea tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Hosea tungtawnin thu a gen masah lai-in, Topa in Hosea kungah, “Pei-in numei pahtat khat na zi-in la inlen, tua nu tawh ta nei in, azieh pen gamsung mite in Topa taisanin pahtatna lienpi bawl uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama pei-in Diblaim’ tanu Gomer a zi-in la a, tua nu gai-in ama tawh tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “A min Jezreel phuoh in; azieh pen a sawt loin Jezreel’ sisan ziehin keima in Jehu’ innkuonte dan ka pie ding a, Israel innkuonte’ uhna gam ka tawpsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Jezreel kuomah Israel’ thaltang ka hliehtawng ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua nu gaikia a, tanu khat nei hi. Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, “A min Lo-ruhamah phuoh in, azieh pen Israel innkuonte ka khuotuo nawn sih ding a, a mawna uh ka maisah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah innkuonte ka khuotuo ding a, thal le namsau, gal simna, sakol le sakol tungtuongte vang tawh hi loin a Topa Pasien uh’ vang tawh amate ka hundam ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lo-ruhamah in nawi a tansah zaw ciengin tua nu gai-in tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Ama’ min Lo-ammi phuoh in, azieh pen note keima’ mite na hi nawn sih vua, kei zong note adingin KEIMA ka hi nawn sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle Israel mite pen tezawh lo, simzawh lo za dongin tuipi senel bangin a tam ding vua, “Ka mite hi lo,” ka cisa amate, “A hingzing Pasien’ tate,” kici ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah mite le Israel mite a kigawmkia ding vua, a makai ding uh khat a se ding uhi; tuale amate in gamh a luo ding vua, tua Jezreel hun pen hun thupi mama hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na sanggampa ‘ka mite’ ci inlen, na sanggamnu’ a kikhuotuo’ ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nu uh kuppi-in thuhil un. azieh pen ama ka zi hi nawn loin a pasal zong ka hi nawn sih hi. A pahtat melsuo khel hinlen, a angkawm nopna lungsim paikhie heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi sihle a puonte hawhin a guohtangin ka omsah ding a, a suo ni-a bangin mi musietin ka koi ding hi. Senel gam gawta bangin ka bawl ding a, a dangta-in ka sisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tate tungah zong khuotuona ka nei sih ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate numei pahtat’ tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nu uh a pahtat ziehin amate a pai ama pen zumhuoi tahin a gamta ahi hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Ka lawm ngaite kungah ka pei ding hi. Amate in kei adingin an le tui, samul puon le saihadiel puon, olive thau, le ka dawn ding ei pie uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama lampi-ah lingthaw ka get ding hi; ama in a lampi a mu thei lo nadingin kul ka cienlu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a lawm ngaite nuadel ding a, hinanle amate a pha sih ding hi. Ama in amate sui ding a, hinanle mu lo ding hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Ka pei ding a, ka pasal masa pen kungah ka kinuale kia ding hi. Azieh pen tu sangin ama tawh ka opton lai nuom zaw tham lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in an, zu, le sathau a pie pa kei ka hi lam le, Baal biehna dinga a nop a thei-a a zah ngun le kham a pie pa keima ka hi lam a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin anlah huna ka ante le lenggazu lah huna ka lenggazute ka nualah kia ding hi. A guohtang hina a sena samul puon le saihadiel puonte ka lakia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in a lawm ngaite muna-ah a puonte ka lempieh ding a, ka khut sung panin koima in ama a hunkhie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in ama’ guolnopna zosie, a pawite, a hla thate, a sabbath nite le a kisesa a pawi bawlte uh ka khawlsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tamte khu ka lawm ngaite ei thapna ahi hi,” ci-a a gen a lenggui lote le a theikungte ka susie ding hi. Tuate gamlah suohsahin gamsate in tuate netum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baal-te pawi bawl ni ciengin amate kungah gimnamtui a hal zieh le, khutsip le suongmanphate tawh a kizep ciengin keima ei mangngilin a lawm ngaite a nuadel ziehin, ama dan ka pie ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ama zawlin senel gamah ka zawpi ding a, damtahin ama ka hopi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in khum mun panin a lengga lote ka pie ding a, Achor Kuompi pen lametna kotpi ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin, “Ka pasal,” ci-in nei hlan ding a, “Ka Baal,” ci-in nei hlan nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen a kam panin Baal pasien-te’ min ka ladawh ding a, amate a min kilo kha nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in note adingin gamsate, vana a leng vate, le leitunga a bawhva ganhingte tawh thuciemna khat ka bawl ding hi; tuale keima in leitung panin thal, namsau, gal kidonate ka phietmang ding a, lungmuong tahin note kang omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in kumtawn zi dingin nang kang la ding a, thudih le thutang, itna kip le hepina tawh ka zi dingin kang la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in citahna tawh ka zi dingin kang la ding hi; tuale nang in Topa na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin kang dawng ding hi, Topa in ci a, keima in vante’ thugen ka dawng ding a, amate in leitung’ thugente a dawng ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuale leitung in an, lenggazu, le sathau-te’ thugente dawng ding a, amate in Jezreel’ thugente a dawng ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale keima adingin gam sungah khaici bangin ama ka tu ding hi. Keima in a kikhuotuo lote ka khuotuo ding a, ka mi ahi lote kungah, “Ka mite na hi uhi,” ka ci ding hi. Ama in, “Nang ka Pasien na hi hi,” ei ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah thu ang genkia a, “Peikia inlen lawm ngaisa le angkawmsa numei khat va ngai in. Israel mite, pasien dangte lamah kihei-in amate in milim biehna-in lengga gaw mohte tawi nan ule Topa in amate a it veve ma bangin tua numei va it in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in ngun shekel sawm le nga le mangbuham homer khat le alang tawh tua nu ka lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale keima in tua nu kungah, “ Ka zi bangin ni tampitah omin na pahtat nawn sih ding a, midangte tawh lumton loin kei tawh zong i lumton sih ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen hun sawtveipi sung kumpi le ulien, biehpiehna, biehna song, siempu puon le teraphim nei loin Israel-te a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Israel-te kihei-in Topa a Pasien ule a kumpipa uh David a sui ding uhi; hun nukhia ciengin amate in zatahna lienpi tawh Topa le ama’ hoina a zuon ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite aw, Topa’ thugen ngai un; azieh pen Topa in gam sunga a tengte mawmatna khat nei hi. Gam sungah citahna, dihna le Pasien theina om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiciemna, kisolna, tuolthana, guhtatna le angkawmnate om a, sisan luonnate khat zaw khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin leitang tau-in a sunga teng zosie a mau uhi; vana a leng vate, gamsate le tuipi ngasate nangawn tawh a maimangtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle koima kisel da hinlen, koima kimawsah sih heh. Azieh pen siempu pa aw, ka kiselpi pa nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sun lai-in na kipal ding a, zan lai-in nang tawh kamsangpa a puaton ding hi. Tuale keima in na nu ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theina a kitasap ziehin ka mite a kisie uhi; nang in theina na nual ziehin ka siempu dingin nang kang nuol hi. Note in na Pasien uh’ thukham na mangngil ziehun, keima in zong na tate uh ka mangngil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate tam semsem leh, kei tunga a mawna uh a tam semsem hi; amate in a minthanna uh maizumna tawh a khel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ka mite’ mawna kivana’n a nei uhi; ka mite a khiel semsem ding a dei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite tunga a tun bangin siempute tungah zong tung ding hi; amau’ tot lampi bangin amate dan pie-in, amau’ gamtat bangin ka thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in nene napi a taizo sih ding uhi; patatna tawh kidim napi a pung sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in pahtatna nuadelin Topa a taisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lenggazu lui le lenggazu a tha in theitelna a lahmang pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite in sing milim po thu a kuppi vua, a ciengkhut un amate tungah thuphuon a gen hi. Bangzieh ahei cile pahtat nopna lungsim in amate lam khielsah a, Pasien taisanin numei pahtat bangin amate a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in muolsang dawn tengah kithoina nei-in, muol tunga gangpi kung, popler kung le terebinth kungte nei-ah biehnate a pie uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tua sing hlimte nuom mama hi. Tua ahi ziehin na tanute in pahtatna a bawl vua, na monute un zong ang a kawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tanute a pahtat cieng ule, na monute in ang a kawm ciengun, dan ka pie sih ding hi; azieh pen pasalte mama a pahtatte tawh kithuo-in, biehinnpi-a numei pahtatte tawh biehpiehna a bawlton uhi. Tam bangin theitelna nei lo mite a kisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel aw, na pahtat vangin Judah in khielna bawlsah sin. Gilgal ah lut sin len, Beth-aven ah peito sin. “ Topa a nungta ahi ma bangin,” ci-in zong kiciem sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawnglaa lungkhau bangin Israel zong a lungkhau hi; Topa in lonona gam lienpi ah a tuunote a vah bangin ama in amate a vah zo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milimte tawh Ephraim kizom hi, ama guohin om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zu dawn zaw ciengun nu le pa mawna bawlin amate a thangtat vua, a vangphatna ding uh sangin zumhuoina lam a deizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huipi in amate a hlakui-in zielmang a, amau’ maitamte ziehin a maizum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siempute aw, tam thu za un! Israel innkuonte aw, tami thu ngai un! Kumpi innkuonte aw, ngai un! Azieh pen note tawh kisai-in thu kikhen ahi hi. Mizpah ah note in thang sie-in, Tabor ah ngen na hlung vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shittim ah dum thuh na to uhi; ahi vangin tuate zosie dan ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in Ephraim ka thei a, keima kung panin Israel kiphuol lo hi; azieh pen Ephraim aw, tu-in ahile nang na pahtat zo hi; Israel zong a thanghuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ gamtatna in a Pasien kung uh a kilesah thei sih hi. Azieh pen a lungsim sung vuah pahtat nopna lungsim om a, Topa a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel’ kilietsahna in ama langkhatah teci pang hi; ama’ mawna sungah Ephraim kipalpua ding hi; Judah zong amate tawh a kipalpua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tuuhon ule a bawnghonte tawh Topa sui-in amate a pei ding vua, ahi vangin amate in ama a mu sih ding uhi; amate kung panin ama a nuakia zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Topa tungah muonna nei loin a gamta uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in zawlta tampi a nei uhi. Tu-in hla tha in a lote utawh amate a valtum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeah ah sakii tum unlen, Ramah ah pengkul mut un. Beth-aven ah pataukona gingsah un. Benjamin aw, na nua en in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dan piehna ni ang tun ciengin Ephraim hawmsuoh ding a, Israel minamte lahah a tung tahtah ding thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah uliente, gamgi suong a khin mite tawh kibang uhi; amate tungah ka thangpaina tui bangin ka sungsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim kibawlsie a, thukhenna ah guol lel hi. Azieh pen ama in a kimang lo nate’ nua zui ding a hanciem mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ziehin Ephraim adingin a pet thei lung tawh ka kibang a, Judah innkuonte adingin a muotsah thei na tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim in a natna mu-in Judah in a hima a mu ciengin, Assyria gamah Ephraim pei-in kumpi lienpa kungah mi a sawl hi. Ahi vangin ama in na natna damsah thei lo a, na hima zong damsah thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Ephraim tungah humpi ka bang ding a, Judah innkuonte tungah humpi khangdawng ka bang ding hi. Kei mama in ka ehmal ding a, ka peisan ding hi. Keima in ka kaiphit ding a, koima in hunkhie zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in a mawna uh pulahin ka mai ei sui masangun, ka opna munah ka kilekia ding hi. Amate a lungkham ciengun ka maipha ang sui ding uhi:
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hing pei un, Topa kungah kilekia vai; azieh pen ama ei ehmal pa hi a, ama in eite ei damsahkia ding hi; ama in ei tehpuong a, i liemmate ei tunpieh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ni ni zaw ciengin ei thakhausah ding hi; ni thum ni ciengin eite ei thosah ding a, tua ciengin ama mai-ah eite i nungta thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite in thei vai, Topa i thei zawh nading hanciem vai; ama ang pei ding pen zing nisuo valon bang ahi hi; leitunga a zu khuopi guo bang le guomalte bangin eite tungah ang zu ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ephraim aw, bang hing law ding ka hei? Judah aw, bang hing law ding ka hei? Nei itna pen zing meiilum kai bang a, tomkal khat sunga a kang pai daitui tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in kamsangte zangin amate ka tenbuong a, ka kam pana a pusuoh kammalte tawh keima in amate ka that hi. Khuovah bangin ka thukhenna a kikhaw suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen itna kip ka dei a, biehpiehna ka dei sih hi. Meihal biehpiehnate sangin Pasien theina ka deizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle amate in Adam bangin thuciemna a palsat vua, khum muna keima tungah tahtai lo tahin gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead pen migilote’ khuopi hi a, sisan ketot tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gutate in mi suom ding a buhdap uh bangin, siempute a honhonin kikhawm uh a amate in Shechem lampi ah tuol a that vua, amate in a mudahuoi mawna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in Israel inn sungah a cimulthaw huoina khat ka mu hi; khum munah Ephraim-te a pahtat vua, Israel-te a thanghuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah aw, nang ading zong anlah hun khat kise zo hi. Ka mite hamphatna ka piehkia a,
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te ka damsah ciengin, Ephraim-te’ sietna le Samaria-te’ gitlo gamtatna teng ang kilang hi; azieh pen amate in zuou le nal tawh na a sem vua, gutate in inn lu-in misuomte in a pulamah mi’ na a lahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanle amate in a gitlona zosie uh ka ciemte lam a ngaisun kha ngai sih uhi. Tu-in amau’ nasepnate in amate kimkot a, ka mai-ah tuate a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau’ gitlona in kumpipa lungdamsah a, amau’ misolna in miliente lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un angkawmte ahi vua, a annel pawi a pawm cieng dong moh-empa’ mei sem ding kul a sa lo lungthu sa tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I kumpipa pawi bawl ni-in uliente in zu a khammat vua, mi simmawte tawh kumpipa kikhut tuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate mei bangin kikuontaw a, amau’ sungah a lungtang uh mei bangin kuong vapom hi; zan tungtawnin amau’ lungthahna mei bangin khu valuoi a, zingmawng ciengin mei bangin a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un lungthu bangin a sa vua, amate in a uliente uh a thatlia uhi; a kumpite uh a puamat vua, koima khat beh in ei ko lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim, minamte tawh kicisaw lo hi; Ephraim, a kikhuleh lo moh tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdangte in ama’ hatna valtum a, hinanle ama in tua thu theikha lo hi; a lu tungah samkang vaupa bang a, hinanle ama in thei kha lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel’ kilietsahna in ama langkhatah teci a pang hi. Hinanle Topa a Pasien uh kungah amate a kilekia tuom sih vua, tam teng zosie ziehin zong ama a sui tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim pen a lungmawl vakhu banga ngaisutna nei lo ahi hi; amate in Egypt mite a hlan vua, Assyria gamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate a pei ciengin amate tungah ka len ka khu ding hi; vana a leng vate bangin amate ka kaikhie suh ding hi; amau’ kikhopna -a thu ka zah dung zui-in amate thu ka hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei kung panin a kihei ziehun gimna a thuoh ding uhi! Kei ei ledo ziehun sietna tuoh ta uheh! Amate ka hunkhie nuom mama a, hinanle amate in kei langkhatah zuouthu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lupna tung vuah a tau vangun, kei kungah lungsim tahtah tawh ang kiko sih uhi; neh le dawn nga thei nadingin amau le amau kikuikehin ei ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate a cil a, a bantha uh a khausah pa khu keima ka hi a, hinanle keima langkhatah gitlo a sawm veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Phattuomna a pie thei lo nate lamah amate a kihei uhi; amate pen a muitang lo thaltang tawh a bang uhi. Amate a kiphatsah ham ziehun a uliente namsau-in a si ding vua, Egypt gam sungah amate mi nuisatin a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na pengkul na nephu tawh tuo in! Langta tawh a kibang khat Topa’ inn tungah a om hi, azieh pen amate in ka thuciemna a susie zo ta vua, ka thukham a palsat zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kungah Israel-te ang kiko vua, “Ka Pasien aw, - koma Israel- in nang kang thei uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel in na hoite pai zo hi; galte in ama a del ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in kei tungtawn loin kumpite koi uhi; amate in kei thei loin uliente zong a koi uhi. Amau’ siet nadingin a ngun le a kham utawh milimte a bawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria aw, na bawngno kinuol hi. Amate tungah ka sin a so hi. Amate bang tanvei maw nei loin om thei ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen tua bawngno khu Israel sung panin khut siem khat’ bawl hi a, Pasien ahi sih hi. Samaria bawngno pen a phalphalin keh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen hui khaici a vaw ziehun amate in pumpei a at ding uhi. Bukungte in vui nei lo a, buvuite in neh ding piengsah lo ding hi; piengsah ma nanleh gamdang mite in netum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel a kipumval ahi ta hi; tu-in kimanna a nei lo beel bangin minamte lahah ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gam-laa a tang tat bangin Assyria ah amate a peito uhi; Ephraim in a lawm ngaite tawh a thaman ding kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in minamte tawh a guoi man ding kiho nan ule, keima in amate tu-in ka kaikhawm ding hi. Kumpite le uliente’ suon vangih nei-ah amate a kilawmlia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim in maw mai nadingin maitam a tam bawl ciengin, tua maitam te ama adingin mawna maitam a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama adingin keima in thuhilna tampi giel nanleng, tuate pen sil lamdang khat bangin kingaisun lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Deiteel biehpiehnate lui-in sa a neh vangun, Topa in amate sang lo hi. Tu-in ama in amau’ khielna ciemte ding a, a mawnate uh dan a pie ding hi; amate Egypt ah kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel in a Bawlpa mangngilin kumpi innte a lam bebe hi. Judah in kul a nei khuopite a lam bebe hi. Ahi vangin a khuopite tungah mei ka sawl ding a, tua mei in ama’ mun muonhuoite a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel aw, lungdam sin! Minamte bangin lungdamin kipah sin; azieh pen na Pasien kung pan tai-in numei pahtat bangin na gamta hi. Ancilna phuol teng zosie ah na pahtat thaman na lunggul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ancilna phuol le lengga suhna in amate a va sih ding a, amate deiza-in lenggazu tha a pieng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ gam sungah amate a om den sih ding vua, ahi vangin Egypt gamah Ephraim kilekia-in, amate in Assyria gam sungah an sieng lo a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Topa tungah dawn thei lenggazu tawh biehna a sung sih ding vua, amau’ biehpiehnate in ama a lungkimsah zo sih ding hi. Tua bang biehpiehnate pen kuosa hangtang tawh kibang lel ding hi; tua kuosa hangtang an a nete zosie a bua ahi ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amau’ neh an pen gilkiel phatna maimai ding ahi bo a, Topa’ inn sungah tua an kitut lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kisesa pawi ni le Topa’ pawi ni ciengin bang bawl ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen sietna panin amate nangawn a suotah uleh, Egypt in amate khawmtuo ding a, Memphis in amate a vui ding hi. Lahkhai in ngun tawh kizem a vanmanphate uh khumang ding a, lingkungte in a puonbuhte uh a khumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dan pieh hun tung zo ta a, thuhkiana hun tung zo ta hi; Israel kiko-in, “Kamsang pa mimaw hi a, hla mipa a lungsim kicing lo hi,” a ci hi. Na mawna uh a gol seng ziehin kigal neina zong a gol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka Pasien adingin kamsangpa pen Ephraim tungah galvil pa hi a, hizongle a lampi teng zosie ah thangsie pa in a thang kamin, a Pasien’ inn sungah kigal neina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeah hun lai ma bangin amau le amau nahpi tahin kisie uhi. Ama in amau’ khielna phawh ding a, a mawnate uh ziehin amate dan a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Senel gam sunga lenggate bangin, keima in Israel ka mu hi. Kum kihei masah pen huna theikung a ga masa pente bangin keima in na pu na pate uh ka mu hi. Ahi vangin Baal-peor ah amate tungin tua a zumhuoi nate tungah a ki-ap vua, a it a ngai uh nate ma bangin amate a kidahhuoi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Va bangin Ephraim-te’ vang lengmang ta a, ta suoh, nupi gai, nau pai ci bangte a om nawn sih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in tate hing nan ule, khat beh a hinsuo lo uh za dongin ka kap ka mausah ding hi. Amate ka taisan ciengin, gimna a thuoh tahtah ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in Ephraim pen a deihuoi lohing lahah a kisuon lutu kungno bangin ka mu a, ahi vangin tu-in Ephraim in tha dingin a tate a peipi kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa aw, amate pie in, Amate bang pie ding na hei? Amate tatolh sulbu le a suoh lo nawitui pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mawna teng zosie uh Gigal ah kipan a, amate ka mudana pen tua muntah ahi hi. Amau’ gitlo gamtatnate ziehin ka inn panin amate ka notmang ding hi. Amate ka it nawn sih ding hi. A uliente zosie mi ledote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ephraim in gimna thuoh a, a huite gaw siengin ga a ga sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in ama thugen a ngai nuom lo ziehun, ka pa Pasien in amate a nuol ding hi. Amate pen minamte lahah mi vahvaite a suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel pen lenggui phung pha ahi a, ama in ga tampi a ga hi. A lengga ga semsem a, ama in maitam lam semsem hi; a gam khantona tawh kizui-in biehna songte bawl bebe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungtang uh a man sih hi; tu-in amau’ khielna paat a puo ding uhi. Topa in a maitam uh satguoi-in a biehna songte uh a susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen tu-in amate in, “ Topa ka zatah lo ziehun kumpi zong ka nei ta sih uhi, ama in kote adingin bang ei seppieh thei ding ahei?” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in thu ginalo po a gen vua, a kampi utawh kiciemin thuciemnate a bawl uhi; Tuaci’n lolai tuma kuohte lahah a po a gunei lopate bangin kiheh kibalna dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beth-aven khuo-a bawngno lim ziehin Samaria-a tengte zau-in a citun uhi. Tami ziehin a mite a kap ding vua, tami thu ziehin milim a bie siempute thumin tau ding uhi. Amate in tua pana a kilamang ama’ vang a kaapi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Assyria kumpi lienpa kungah sieh le kaih a pieh dingin tuami kipuo ding hi. Ephraim kimaizumsah ding a, a milim ziehin Israel maizum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui maitanga a lam tuiphuon bangin Samaria kumpipa a kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel’ mawna ahi Aven munsangte kisusie ding a, a maitamte uh tungah ling le khaute a po ding hi. Amate in muolsangte kungah, kote ei khusuh un, a ci ding vua, muolte kungah, kote tungah hing kiesuh ta un, a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel aw, Gibeah hun peh panin nang na maw zo ta bo hi; amate in khum munah mawna a bawl lai uhi. Gal in Gibeah ah amate nuaphah lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu manglo mite langkhatah dan pie dingin kang pei ding a, khielna nam ni a bawl ziehun amate dan ka pieh ciengin, amate langkhatah minamte ang kikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim pen hoitaha a kisin ancil ding a thanuom bawnglaa ahi a, keima in a zol sipsep a ngawng ah kol ka na bul sih hi; Hinanle Ephraim pen lei ka kalsah ding hi. Judah in lo a kaih lo phamaw ding a, Jacob in ama adingin lo a hlo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noma adingin dihna khaici tu un; itna kip at unlen a kihlo nai lo lote kalkang un. Azieh pen ama ang pei-in note tungah thumana guo ang zuhsah thei nadingin Topa sui hun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in lo kaih bangin gitlona lo na kai vua, bu at bangin thutang lo na at zo uhi; note in zuou phuona ga zong na ne zo ta uhi. Azieh pen note in thahatna na suong vua, na galhang honpite na ngam seng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin gal a kido ni-in Shalman in Beth-arbel a suhsiet bangin, a tate utawh nute tuol dena-a a kinei hun lai-a bangin, na mite langkhatah gal dona husa om ding a, na kulpi zosie uh a kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bethel aw, na gitlona a gol ziehin nang tungah tua bangin ang kibawl ding hi. Khuovah ciengin Israel’ kumpipa kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A khangmoi lai-in Israel ka it a, Egypt panin ka tapa ka hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in hlan semsem leng, kei kung pan gamla pei semsem hi; amate in Baal-te kungah kithoina a nei den vua, milimte kungah gimnamtui a hal den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle Ephraim lam pei a kisinsah pa keima ka hi a, ka khut tawh amate ka tu hi; ahi vangin ka damsah lam amate in a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migitna le itna khau tawh amate ka pui hi. Keima in a khagu tunga hahkol sutpiehin awnsuhin amate an ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gamah amate a kilekia ding vua, Assyria-te pen amau’ kumpi hi ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ka kungah amate ang kilekia nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khuopite sung vuah namsau kileh ding a, tua in thuphuon nga siempute vatmai-in, a gelnate ma un amate valtum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite in kei kung panin kihei ding a sawm teitei uhi. A sangna munah amate a kiko vangun amate kilamto tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim aw, bangci danin nang hing tan thei ding ka hei? Israel aw, bangci danin midang hing pie thei ding ka hei? Bangci bangin Admah bangin nang hing bawl thei ding ka hei? Bangci bangin Zeboiim bangin hing bawl thei ding ka hei? Ka sungah ka lungtang kilumletlet hi; ka lainatna a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zauhuoi ka lungthahna ka tungsah sih ding hi; Ephraim ka susiekia nawn sih ding hi; azieh pen keima Pasien ka hi a, note lahah a om mihing ka hi sih hi. Siengtho Pa ka hi ziehin a thangpaisa-in kang pei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in humpi banga a hawh Topa a zui ding uhi; ama a hawh ciengin nitumna panin citun kawmin a tate ang pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vate bangin Egypt gam panin citun kawmin ang leng ding vua, Assyria gam panin vakhu bangin ang leng ding uhi; Keima in a inn ciet vuah ka peisahkia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim in zuouthu tawh ei kuikhum a, Israel innkuon in solna tawh eite ei kuikhum hi; ahi vangin Judah tawh Pasien zawhton lai a, Siengtho Pa tungah ama muon huoi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim in ganhon bangin huipi cing a, sunthapai-in nisuona huipi nuadel hi; amate in zuouthu le tatsietna khangsah uhi; amate in Assyria tawh thukimna bawlin, tuale Egypt ah sathau kipuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Judah tungah mawsahna ding thu nei a, a gamtatna tawh kituohin ama in Jacob dan pie a, a sepna tawh kituohin ama a thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nu gil sungah ama in a sanggampa’ ketul man a, a khangham ciengin Pasien tawh ama kibuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantungmi tawh ama kibuonin zo a, kapin ama’ maipha a sui hi; ama in Bethel ah ama mu a, khum munah ama a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien, ama’ min khu Topa ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle note na hi ule Pasien lamah kinuale un, itna le thutang tukip unlen, na Pasien uh muong zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khutah tawitena man lo a tawi, sumbawl ama in mi gawt nuomsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim in, “Kasai, kei ka hau ta a, keima dingin neisa a kicing zo ta hi; ka hauna zosiete ziehin ka sungah maw thei nading khielna kimu lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei pen Egypt gam panin note’ Topa Pasien ka hi hi; keima in a kisesa na pawi nite uh ma bangin, puonbuhah note kang tengsahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamsangte kungah thu ka gen hi; mangmunate a khangsah pa kei ka hi a, kamsangte tungtawnin kisietna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ah khielna om a, amate bangma lo a suoh valon ding uhi. Amate in Gilgal ah bawngtangte tawh biehpiehna a bawl vua, a maitamte uh lolai tuma kuohte tunga suong kicieng tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aram gamah Jacob tai a, Israel in a zi thalawna-in khum munah na semin, a zi thalawna-in tuu a cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Egypt panin kamsang khat zangin Israel peipi a, ama in kamsang khat zangin ama a kemcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraim in gitlona nasietahin bawl a, tuaci’n Topa in ama tungah a mawna teng tungsah ding a, a mi simmawna teng zong ama tungah thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim in thu a gen ciengin mite zau-in a citun uhi; Israel sungah ama a kipatawi hi; ahi vangin Baal tungtawnin khielna bawlin ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in amate in mawna a bawl bebe vua, amate adingin a kisung milim bawlin, amau’ theitelna tawh kituohin ngun milim a bawl vua, tuate pen a unsiengin khutsiemte bawl ahi hi. Amate in, “Tamte tungah kithoi un,” a ci uhi. Mite in bawngno limte a nam uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate pen zingmawnga a kai khuovui, a kang pai daitu, ancilna pana hui in a mutmang ansi le tawlet pana a pusuoh meikhu tawh a kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle Egypt gama kipanin kei pen Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi; note in keima longal Pasien dang na thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Senel gam gawta ah an tawh ang vah pa keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ka va ciengin a gil uh a va hi; a gilva ciengun lah a kiphasah zel uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate in keima ei mangngil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate adingin humpi ka bang ding a, kamkei bangin lampi gei-ah amate ka buhdap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A no kilahpieh vompi bangin amate ka bawh ding a, keima in amau’ lutang tuom a paante ka balkehpieh ding hi. Humpi bangin tua sungah amate ka nawmval ding a, gamsate bangin amate ka ehmal gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel aw, nang kang susie ding hi; koi in nang ang panpi ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ang hutdam thei nadingin tu-in na kumpipa hei-a om ahei? Na khuopi zosie-a makaite, nang in, “Kumpi khat le makaite ei pie in,” na cite hei-ah a om ta uh e?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lungthah ziehin keima in kumpi khat kang pie a, ka thangpai ziehin keima in ama ka la dawhkia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraim’ khielna a kitunpieh hi; ama’ mawna kikoicing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama adingin nausuoh natna tung a, hinanle ama pen tapa mawlawm ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile a suo hun a tun ciengin naubu gong panin ama le ama ang pusuoh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Misikhuo khut sung pan amate tan ding ka hi amah? Sina panin amate hunkhie ding ka mah? Sina aw, na gu hei-ah om a, Misikhuo aw, na suhsietna hei-ah om ahei? Ka mit panin lainatna a kiphuolmang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pumpengte lahah ama khanpha mama nanle senel gam panin Topa’ nisuona huipi ang lang ding hi; tuale a tuinah kangin a tuikhuh a gawta ding hi. Tua in a gou koina sunga om van manpha zosie a semmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria in ama’ khielna kipuoh ding hi, azieh pen ama in a Pasien a ledo hi; namsau tawh amate si ding a, a nausente uh a kituoncilin, a numei gaite uh’ gil kikuikeh pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel aw, Topa na Pasien kungah hing kilekia in. Azieh pen na khielna ziehin nang na kipalpua ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thugen ding hing keng inlen, Topa kungah hing kilekia in; ama kungah, “Khielna zosie lamang in; a hoi thute pom in, tuale kote in ka kam uh’ a ga kang pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria in ei hundam lo ding hi; sakolte tungah ka tuong sih ding uhi; ka khut utawh ka bawlsate uh kungah, ‘Kote’ Pasien,’ ka ci nawn sih ding uhi. Nangma sungah tagate in hepina a mu uhi,” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ thumanlona ka damsah ding hi; amate suohta tahin ka it ding hi, azieh pen amate kung panin ka lungthahna kihei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel tungah daitui ka bang ding hi; unoh paape bangin ama paa ding a, Lebanon gamlah bangin amate zung hla ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ dawnmeng teng bazau ta ding hi; ama’ hoi dan pen olive kung bang ding a, ama’ namtui dan pen Lebanon tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima’ hlim nei-ah amate ang tengkia ding vua, huon lei bangin amate khanpha mama ding uhi; lenggui bangin amate a paa ding vua, a gimnamtui dan pen Lebanon lenggazu a bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim aw, milimte tawh kei bang kisai ka hei? Nang ang dawng pa le nang ang don pa keima ka hi hi. Kei pen na a dawng taasing tawh ka kibang hi; na thumanna pen keima kung pana ang pei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipilte in tam thute a theitel uhi; thu khinkhai theite in tuate a thei uhi. Azieh pen Topa’ lampi man a, thutang mite in tua lampi zui uhi, ahi vangin thupalsat mite ahi ule tuate sungah a kipalpuo uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
